{"id": "first-block-cache", "name": "First Block Cache (FBCache)", "family": "patch", "subfamily": "step-cache", "plain": "Runs the first transformer block every step, and compares its output or residual to the previous step's. If they barely changed, the remaining blocks are skipped and a stored tail residual is applied. It uses a real model output as the signal, so needs no per-model calibration, at the cost of one block per step.", "math": "Base: \u03b4 = mean|f_t \u2212 f_prev| / mean|f_prev|, f = first block residual or output. Skip if \u03b4<\u03c4; out = x + R_tail.\nNo accumulation between steps in these implementations.\nH3 (duckyshell): f = first block residual; optional temporal guard adds per-latent-frame max of \u03b4; also requires hits < max_consecutive(2); window by sigma; tail residual per uuid context.\nLightning: f = first block img output; numerator over the current value rather than the previous.\nlldacing: are_two_tensors_similar with residual diff threshold, Flux/Wan/Mochi/LTX/Hunyuan enter points.", "props": {"hook": "H3: set_model_patch_replace dit double_block per index + DIFFUSION_MODEL, OUTER_SAMPLE wrappers. Lightning: dm.forward_orig reassigned with types.MethodType. lldacing: forward override + OUTER_SAMPLE/other wrappers.", "architectures": "duckyshell, RH, TensorClay, DrBearJew, T8mars audio: MiniMax H3. T8mars BlockCache: Qwen-Image 2.1. Lightning: Flux. lldacing: Flux, HunyuanVideo, LTXV, MochiVideo, WanVideo.", "params": "H3 threshold=0.10,start=.10,end=.95,max_consecutive=2"}, "evidence": [{"where": "duckyshell__ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-FirstBlockCache/nodes.py:30", "symbol": "PRESETS"}, {"where": "duckyshell__ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-FirstBlockCache/nodes.py:161", "symbol": "numerator"}, {"where": "duckyshell__ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-FirstBlockCache/nodes.py:171", "symbol": "use_cache"}, {"where": "duckyshell__ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-FirstBlockCache/nodes.py:229", "symbol": "patch"}, {"where": "duckyshell__ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-FirstBlockCache/nodes.py:206",